{"meta":{"id":"mobile-wedding","category":"it/projects/done","title":"모바일 청첩장 (React)","subtitle":"","summary":"스와이프 섹션 전환, 참석 등록 · 축하 메시지 전송, 카카오맵 · 길찾기 딥링크 · 카카오 공유, Firebase 사진 업로드","tags":["react","청첩장","모바일","react-swipeable","kakao map","firebase","keen-slider","framer-motion"],"color":"rose","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-rose","source":"wedding","updatedAt":""},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-rose-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-rose-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-rose-50 text-rose-700 border border-rose-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></span>REACT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">모바일 청첩장 (React)</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-rose-50/70 border border-rose-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-rose-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 스와이프 섹션 전환, 참석 등록 · 축하 메시지 전송, 카카오맵 · 길찾기 딥링크 · 카카오 공유, Firebase 사진 업로드</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">개요</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">React 로 만든 <strong>모바일 청첩장 웹앱</strong>입니다. 시작 애니메이션 뒤에 스와이프(상하좌우)나 버튼으로 네 개의 섹션을 넘겨 보고, 참석 등록 · 축하 메시지는 전송 API 로 보내며, 사진은 Firebase Storage 에 올립니다. GitHub Pages 로 배포했습니다.</p><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">※ 이름 · 날짜 · 장소 · 계좌 · 연락처 · 사진 같은 개인 정보는 이 문서에 옮기지 않고 구조와 기능만 정리했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">실행 화면</h2></div><div class=\"w-full grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-3 items-start\"><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/mobile-wedding/01-invitation.png\" alt=\"모시는 글 — 초대 문구\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">모시는 글 — 초대 문구</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/mobile-wedding/02-directions.png\" alt=\"오시는 길 — 카카오맵 (확대 · 축소 · 원래 위치로 · 대중교통)\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">오시는 길 — 카카오맵 (확대 · 축소 · 원래 위치로 · 대중교통)</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"my-3 flex flex-col items-center gap-1.5\"><img src=\"{{ASSET}}/it/projects/assets/mobile-wedding/03-message.png\" alt=\"전하는 곳 — 메시지 보내기 · 스냅샷 업로드\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"max-w-full h-auto rounded-xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\"><figcaption class=\"text-[11px] text-stone-400\">전하는 곳 — 메시지 보내기 · 스냅샷 업로드</figcaption></figure></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">모바일 크기(390px)로 캡처했고, 이름이 나오는 하단(양가 · 신랑 · 신부 · 일시)은 잘라냈고, 장소 · 주소는 ○○ 로 바꾸고 사진 · 지도는 흐리게 처리했습니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">기술 스택</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">분류</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">사용 기술</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">프레임워크</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">React 18, Create React App (react-scripts 5), 개발 서버 포트 9090 (cross-env)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">라우팅 · 메타</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">react-router-dom 6, react-helmet-async (공유 미리보기 og 태그)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">스타일</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Sass (SCSS 모듈), 커스텀 폰트</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">애니메이션 · 제스처</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">framer-motion (시작 화면), react-swipeable (상하좌우 스와이프), keen-slider (갤러리)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">지도 · 공유</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Kakao Maps SDK, Kakao 공유(Link), 네이버지도 · T맵 앱 딥링크</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">백엔드</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Firebase (Storage · Firestore · Analytics), 메시지 전송 API (환경변수 URL, axios)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">기타</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">react-copy-to-clipboard (계좌 복사), react-modal</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">배포</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">GitHub Pages (package.json homepage)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">폴더 구성</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">tree</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">wedding/\r\n├─ .env.example                  # 필요한 환경변수 목록 (.env 는 커밋하지 않음)\r\n├─ public/index.html\r\n└─ src/\r\n   ├─ App.js                     # 시작 화면 → 본문, 스와이프로 섹션 전환\r\n   ├─ firebase.js                # Firebase 초기화 (환경변수)\r\n   ├─ assets/ (fonts, images)\r\n   ├─ styles/                    # reset · define · layout · fonts\r\n   └─ components/\r\n      ├─ StartPage.js            # 시작 애니메이션 (framer-motion)\r\n      ├─ Haeder.js · Footer.js · MenuPage.js\r\n      ├─ DynamicMeta.js          # og:title 등 메타 태그\r\n      ├─ Main.js                 # 참석 등록 폼 + 섹션 버튼 + 섹션 본문\r\n      └─ content/\r\n         ├─ Report.js            # 모시는 글 (초대 이미지)\r\n         ├─ Directions.js · KakaoMap.js · MapLinks.js   # 오시는 길\r\n         ├─ loadKakaoMapScript.js · KakaoSharePage.js    # 카카오 SDK\r\n         ├─ BankAccount.js       # 전하는 마음 (계좌 복사 · 축하 메시지 · 스냅샷)\r\n         ├─ Gallery.js           # 갤러리 (keen-slider)\r\n         └─ subContents/firebaseImg.js   # 업로드 전 이미지 축소</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">화면 흐름</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 space-y-2 rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 bg-stone-50/70 p-3 sm:p-4 overflow-x-auto\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">StartPage</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">시작 애니메이션</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-rose-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">타이머</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">Main</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">참석 등록 폼 + 섹션</span></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 sm:gap-2 min-w-max\"><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">모시는 글</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">1</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-rose-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">스와이프</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">오시는 길</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">2</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">전하는 마음</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">3</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">갤러리</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">4</span></span><span class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-stone-400 px-0.5\"><span class=\"text-[9px] font-semibold text-rose-600 leading-none mb-0.5\">처음으로</span><span class=\"text-sm leading-none\">→</span></span><span class=\"inline-flex flex-col items-center rounded-lg border border-rose-200 bg-white px-2.5 py-1.5 shadow-xs\"><span class=\"text-[12px] font-semibold text-stone-800 whitespace-nowrap\">모시는 글</span><span class=\"text-[10px] text-stone-400 whitespace-nowrap\">1</span></span></div></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">섹션</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">컴포넌트</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">내용</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">1. 모시는 글</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Report</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">초대 이미지 — 이미지가 다 불러와지면 표시</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">2. 오시는 길</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Directions · KakaoMap · MapLinks</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">카카오맵 지도 + 카카오맵 · 네이버지도 · T맵 앱으로 길찾기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">3. 전하는 마음</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">BankAccount</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">계좌 복사, 축하 메시지 보내기, 스냅샷 사진 올리기</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">4. 갤러리</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Gallery</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">keen-slider 로 사진 넘겨 보기</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">스와이프로 섹션 넘기기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">const handlers = useSwipeable({\r\n  onSwipedLeft: (eventData) =&gt; {\r\n    if (!isZooming() &amp;&amp; !eventData.event.target.closest(&quot;.no-slide-area&quot;)) {\r\n      handleAction(&quot;Left&quot;);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  onSwipedRight: (eventData) =&gt; {\r\n    if (!isZooming() &amp;&amp; !eventData.event.target.closest(&quot;.no-slide-area&quot;)) {\r\n      handleAction(&quot;Right&quot;);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  onSwipedUp: (eventData) =&gt; {\r\n    if (!isZooming() &amp;&amp; !eventData.event.target.closest(&quot;.no-slide-area&quot;)) {\r\n      handleAction(&quot;Up&quot;);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n  onSwipedDown: (eventData) =&gt; {\r\n    if (!isZooming() &amp;&amp; !eventData.event.target.closest(&quot;.no-slide-area&quot;)) {\r\n      handleAction(&quot;Down&quot;);\r\n    }\r\n  },\r\n});</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">확대 중이거나 <code class='font-mono text-[12px]'>.no-slide-area</code>(입력 폼 등) 안에서 시작한 스와이프는 무시합니다. 마지막 섹션 다음은 첫 섹션으로 돌아갑니다(순환).</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">참석 등록</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// 참석 등록 — 이름 · 연락처 확인 후 전송 API 로 POST (중복 전송 방지)\r\nconst handleSubmit = async () =&gt; {\r\n  if (isSubmitting) return;\r\n  setIsSubmitting(true);\r\n\r\n  if (!sender.trim()) { alert(&quot;보내는 사람을 입력해주세요!&quot;); setIsSubmitting(false); return; }\r\n  if (phone.length &lt; 10) { alert(&quot;전화번호를 확인부탁드립니다.&quot;); setIsSubmitting(false); return; }\r\n\r\n  const data = { sender: sender.trim(), message: phone.trim(), recipient: recipient.trim(), msgType: &quot;참석&quot; };\r\n  try {\r\n    const response = await axios.post(process.env.REACT_APP_MSG_URL, data);\r\n    if (response.status === 200) { alert(&quot;참석 확인되었습니다.&quot;); setCkSendMsg(true); }\r\n  } finally {\r\n    setIsSubmitting(false);\r\n  }\r\n};</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">카카오맵 SDK 한 번만 불러오기</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">export const loadKakaoMapScript = () =&gt; {\r\n  return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {\r\n\r\n    if (kakaoMapScriptLoaded) {\r\n      resolve(window.kakao); // 이미 로드된 경우 Kakao 객체 반환\r\n    } else if (!window.kakao || !window.kakao.maps) {\r\n      const kakaoScript = document.createElement(&quot;script&quot;);\r\n      kakaoScript.src = `https://dapi.kakao.com/v2/maps/sdk.js?appkey=${process.env.REACT_APP_KAKAO_API_KEY}&amp;autoload=false&amp;libraries=services,clusterer,drawing`;\r\n      kakaoScript.async = false;\r\n\r\n      kakaoScript.onload = () =&gt; {\r\n        window.kakao.maps.load(() =&gt; {\r\n          kakaoMapScriptLoaded = true; // 로드 완료 상태 설정\r\n          resolve(window.kakao); // Kakao 객체 반환\r\n        });\r\n      };\r\n\r\n      kakaoScript.onerror = () =&gt; reject(new Error(&quot;Kakao Maps API 로드 실패&quot;));\r\n\r\n      document.head.appendChild(kakaoScript);\r\n    } else {\r\n      resolve(window.kakao); // 이미 로드된 경우 Kakao 객체 반환\r\n    }\r\n  });\r\n};</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">autoload=false 로 스크립트를 넣고 kakao.maps.load 콜백에서 Promise 를 풀어, 여러 컴포넌트가 불러도 스크립트가 한 번만 로드되게 합니다.</p></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">길찾기 · 공유</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// 지도 앱 길찾기 딥링크 (좌표 · 장소명은 변수)\r\nconst naverUrl = `nmap://navigation?dlat=${latitude}&amp;dlng=${longitude}&amp;dname=${placeName}`;\r\nconst tmapUrl  = `tmap://route?goalname=Location&amp;goalx=${longitude}&amp;goaly=${latitude}`;</pre></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// 카카오톡 공유 (피드형)\r\nwindow.Kakao.init(process.env.REACT_APP_KAKAO_API_KEY);\r\n\r\nwindow.Kakao.Link.sendDefault({\r\n  objectType: &quot;feed&quot;,\r\n  content: {\r\n    title: &quot;&lt;공유 제목&gt;&quot;,\r\n    description: &quot;&lt;공유 설명&gt;&quot;,\r\n    imageUrl: &quot;&lt;대표 이미지 주소&gt;&quot;,\r\n    link: { webUrl: &quot;&lt;청첩장 주소&gt;&quot;, mobileWebUrl: &quot;&lt;청첩장 주소&gt;&quot; },\r\n  },\r\n  buttons: [{ title: &quot;지도 보기&quot;, link: { … } }],\r\n});</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">사진 업로드 전 축소 (firebaseImg.js)</h2></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\">업로드 전에 canvas 로 가로 · 세로 최대 1024px 로 비율을 유지해 줄여서 용량을 줄인 뒤 Firebase Storage 에 올립니다.</p><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">javascript</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">// 이미지 리사이즈 함수 (10MB로 줄이기)\r\nconst resizeImage = (file, maxSizeMB = 1) =&gt; {\r\n   return new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {\r\n       const img = new Image();\r\n       const reader = new FileReader();\r\n\r\n       reader.onload = (e) =&gt; {\r\n           img.src = e.target.result;\r\n       };\r\n\r\n       reader.onerror = reject;\r\n       reader.readAsDataURL(file);\r\n\r\n       img.onload = () =&gt; {\r\n           const canvas = document.createElement(&#x27;canvas&#x27;);\r\n           const ctx = canvas.getContext(&#x27;2d&#x27;);\r\n\r\n           // 원본 이미지의 비율을 유지하며 크기 조정\r\n           const maxWidth = 1024; // 최대 너비\r\n           const maxHeight = 1024; // 최대 높이\r\n           let width = img.width;\r\n           let height = img.height;\r\n\r\n           // 비율에 맞춰서 이미지 크기 변경\r\n           if (width &gt; height) {\r\n               if (width &gt; maxWidth) {\r\n                   height = Math.round((height * maxWidth) / width);\r\n                   width = maxWidth;\r\n               }\r\n           } else {</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-rose-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">환경변수 (.env)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">변수</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">용도</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">REACT_APP_KAKAO_API_KEY</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">카카오 지도 · 공유 JavaScript 키</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">REACT_APP_API_KEY · PROJECT_ID · MSG_ID · APP_ID · MEASUREMENT_ID</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">Firebase 설정값</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-rose-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\">REACT_APP_MSG_URL</td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">참석 등록 · 축하 메시지를 받는 전송 API 주소</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n","path":"it/projects/done/mobile-wedding","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"projects","title":"프로젝트","path":"it/projects"},{"id":"done","title":"완료","path":"it/projects/done"}],"hasImage":false}